  "description": "<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\">\r\n<article class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&:has([data-writing-block])>*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-turn-id=\"request-698efa5e-3908-8397-af10-72fb3ac87537-11\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-188\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" tabindex=\"-1\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"fe88bb01-826c-4dc2-a3c7-83c0a8dcbec3\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"46\" data-end=\"316\">LEGO DC Super-Villains is een actie-avonturengame voor de Nintendo Switch waarin je het opneemt tegen bekende schurken uit het DC-universum. De game combineert humor, samenwerking en LEGO-thema’s met een zelfgemaakt verhaal waarin jij de hoofdrol speelt als superschurk.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"577\"><strong data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"359\">Wat is het product, waarvoor geschikt</strong><br data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"362\">Deze game is geschikt voor spelers die houden van LEGO-games met humor, coöperatieve gameplay en lichte actie-elementen. Ideaal voor kinderen, gezinnen en fans van het DC-universum, lokaal of online samen te spelen.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"844\"><strong data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"608\">Korte productbeschrijving</strong><br data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"611\">In LEGO DC Super-Villains speel je als een superschurk die samenwerkt met bekende DC-bad guys om de wereld te redden — op hun eigen manier! Je verkent levels, verzamelt LEGO-stukken en opent nieuwe personages met unieke vaardigheden.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"846\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"860\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"879\"><strong data-start=\"861\" data-end=\"879\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"884\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"901\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"1095\">\r\n<li data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"949\">\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"949\">⭐ Humorvolle LEGO-actie in het DC-universum</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"989\">\r\n<p data-start=\"952\" data-end=\"989\">⭐ Geschikt voor solo en multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1045\">\r\n<p data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1045\">⭐ Veel speelbare personages met unieke vaardigheden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1095\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1095\">⭐ Toegankelijke gameplay voor alle leeftijden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1100\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1122\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1363\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1152\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1152\">Platform: Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1180\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1180\">Genre: Actie / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1222\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1222\">Spelmodus: Singleplayer / Multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1275\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1275\">Uitgever: Warner Bros. Interactive Entertainment</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1304\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1304\">Taal: Engels (meertalig)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1332\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1307\" data-end=\"1332\">Opslagmedium: Cartridge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1333\" data-end=\"1363\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1335\" data-end=\"1363\">Leeftijdsindicatie: PEGI 7</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1365\" data-end=\"1368\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1370\" data-end=\"1388\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1443\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1422\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1422\">Nintendo Switch gamecartridge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1423\" data-end=\"1443\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1425\" data-end=\"1443\">Origineel doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1448\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1450\" data-end=\"1472\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1505\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
